<title>NORWAY: Norway's June PPI rose 0.1 pct mnth/mnth.</title>
<headline>Norway's June PPI rose 0.1 pct mnth/mnth.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> NORWAY PRODUCER PRICES    JUNE 1997  MAY 1997  JUNE 1996</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	 +0.1	 +0.5	-0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	   +2.0	 +1.6	+1.2</p>
<p> Index (base 1981)	    160.8	160.7     157.6</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
